# Flames for the Dead (battlefield.flames_for_the_dead#areas): areas 2 and 3. Ulmia's field 8: option 2 enters area 2,
# the Snoll Tzar +1 killed, five ticks, the win 32001 (params area 2), finished: Three Paths' Bearclaw Pinnacle 32001
# moves Ulmia's field 8 to 9, 1000 XP, title 364. A GM sets the field back to 8 and option 3 enters area 3 (its update
# params [2,0,100,17,1], area 2's [2,0,0,1800]); its Snoll Tzar (+2) is killed, five ticks, the win 32001 (params area
# 3), finished: Three Paths' 32001 moves the field to 9 again, no second XP or title in the trace.
lists BearclawPinnacle/Wind_Pillar_1/onTrigger BearclawPinnacle/onEventUpdate/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=BearclawPinnacle pos=-720,9,-441 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop ThreePaths current
login
missionstatus Cop 8 pos=4               # a GM
trigger Wind_Pillar_1
update 32000 option=2                   # area 2
finish
tick 2000
kill SNOLL_TZAR_OFFSET+1
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
missionstatus Cop 8 pos=4               # a GM
trigger Wind_Pillar_1
update 32000 option=3                   # area 3
finish
tick 2000
kill SNOLL_TZAR_OFFSET+2
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
finish
